{
  "why": [
    "The request path, read by both languages (F44-063, F44-064 c; ruled",
    "2026-11-23). Go's severity (cli/internal/severity BuildGraph) asks which",
    "components a request from an entry point can reach; Python's",
    "SystemGraph.upstream_connections (shared/culprit_model/graph.py, which the",
    "dashboard's request path uses) asks which connections a request from a",
    "component can cross. Both walk the same edges: on_request_path and unknown",
    "are followed, background is not.",
    "",
    "An edge of unknown criticality (criticality omitted is unknown) does not",
    "say whether a request waits on it. Following it as if it did overstates;",
    "dropping it understates. So a component reachable from an entry point",
    "only through such an edge is 'unknown', naming the first unknown edge on",
    "the way, and its divergences have severity unknown. A component with a",
    "route of classified edges is on_request_path whatever else reaches it.",
    "",
    "Each case gives the entries (Go derives them: a frontend or gateway, or a",
    "component nothing connects to that connects to something) and every",
    "component's state. Go checks the states and the severity each gives;",
    "Python walks upstream_connections from every entry and checks that what",
    "it reaches is exactly the components that are not not_on_path, and that",
    "each 'via' edge is on its path with criticality unknown."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "every edge classified",
      "components": [
        {"name": "web", "kind": "frontend"},
        {"name": "orders", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "payments", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "recon", "kind": "service"}
      ],
      "connections": [
        {"from": "web", "to": "orders", "criticality": "on_request_path"},
        {"from": "orders", "to": "payments", "criticality": "on_request_path"},
        {"from": "orders", "to": "recon", "criticality": "background"}
      ],
      "entries": ["web"],
      "reach": {
        "web": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "orders": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "payments": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "recon": {"state": "not_on_path"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an unclassified edge, and what lies beyond it",
      "components": [
        {"name": "web", "kind": "frontend"},
        {"name": "orders", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "payments", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "stripe", "kind": "external_api"}
      ],
      "connections": [
        {"from": "web", "to": "orders", "criticality": "on_request_path"},
        {"from": "orders", "to": "payments"},
        {"from": "payments", "to": "stripe", "criticality": "on_request_path"}
      ],
      "entries": ["web"],
      "reach": {
        "web": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "orders": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "payments": {"state": "unknown", "via": {"from": "orders", "to": "payments"}},
        "stripe": {"state": "unknown", "via": {"from": "orders", "to": "payments"}}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an explicit unknown edge, and a classified route to the same component",
      "components": [
        {"name": "web", "kind": "frontend"},
        {"name": "orders", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "inventory", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "audit", "kind": "service"}
      ],
      "connections": [
        {"from": "web", "to": "inventory", "criticality": "unknown"},
        {"from": "web", "to": "orders", "criticality": "on_request_path"},
        {"from": "orders", "to": "inventory", "criticality": "on_request_path"},
        {"from": "inventory", "to": "audit", "criticality": "unknown"}
      ],
      "entries": ["web"],
      "reach": {
        "web": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "orders": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "inventory": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "audit": {"state": "unknown", "via": {"from": "inventory", "to": "audit"}}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a background edge is not followed, even into an unknown one",
      "components": [
        {"name": "api", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "jobs", "kind": "service"},
        {"name": "mailer", "kind": "service"}
      ],
      "connections": [
        {"from": "api", "to": "jobs", "criticality": "background"},
        {"from": "jobs", "to": "mailer"}
      ],
      "entries": ["api"],
      "reach": {
        "api": {"state": "on_request_path"},
        "jobs": {"state": "not_on_path"},
        "mailer": {"state": "not_on_path"}
      }
    }
  ]
}
